comments.body:
Many method names in `WalletImpl` have the same words as in the method names of `CWallet`, so along the same lines:

 ```diff
- bool isCrypted() override { return m_wallet->HasEncryptionKeys(); }
+ bool hasEncryptionKeys() override { return m_wallet->HasEncryptionKeys(); } 
```
